{"repositoryId":1414553221,"availability":"available","full":"lomska/Global-Shifts-Explorer","name":"Global-Shifts-Explorer","description":"This Streamlit app allows you to explore key global economic and social changes over recent decades using a curated set of publicly available indicators.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-11T16:40:53Z","updated":"2026-10-14T11:33:19Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://global-shifts-explorer.streamlit.app/","topics":["country-comparison","dashboard","data-visualization","demographics","development-indicators","economics","imf","open-data","pandas","plotly","python","streamlit","streamlit-app","sustainable-development-goals","time-series","world-bank"],"demo":"https://global-shifts-explorer.streamlit.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T02:59:54.275Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T02:59:54.275Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T02:59:54.275Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-17T02:59:54.275Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Live app: global-shifts-explorer.streamlit.app","This Streamlit app gathers a curated set of publicly available indicators, from fiscal figures to self-reported happiness, so you can quickly explore how the world has changed over recent decades. Each country is treated as a data point, and each year as a time step. Watching how countries spread out along an indicator, and how that spread changes over time, brings significant shifts into view at a glance."],"features":["The app needs no local data files—it fetches data directly from the publishers' APIs and refreshes it daily, so the numbers stay current."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/lomska/Global-Shifts-Explorer/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"80b3d0cb4245f966015dbcfb5957948a2eff99a45ada72149f0833b9a9ebb0a4","extractedAt":"2026-10-17T02:59:54.406Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T02:59:54.406